---
description: Cursor write-scope guardrail
alwaysApply: true
---

- The active Task allowed_write_paths is a hard allowlist, not a suggestion.
- Never edit governance-only paths during an ACTIVE or REVIEW Sprint: build-spec/, harness/, .cursor/, .github/, AGENTS.md, delivery/templates/.
- delivery/deltas/ is human-governed. Cursor may create/update Findings, but must not approve or author a DESIGN_DELTA decision.
- When the active Sprint is BLOCKED, do not change src/ or tests/.
- If required work falls outside allowed_write_paths, create a Finding instead of expanding the Task yourself.
